==Russian==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ru|de|Marzipan}}, from {{der|ru|it|marzapane}} (misinterpreted as if from Latin {{m|la|Marci}} {{m|la|panis}} ‘Mark's bread’), now thought originally to come from [[w:Martaban|Martaban]], a Burmese port known for its spice exports.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|марципа́н}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|марципа́н}}

# [[marzipan]], [[marchpane]]

